{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3396a5a255509740bf505d320cfa236749e0341f5f5d4fbec5047f5f88f22db1","ja":"次に想いを叫ぶのは……","zh":"接下来要呐喊心声的是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"23c878f5c25387ae934f8bf01cc1b7a9b478a7905c95d24de99e39122c4332d1","ja":"「2年3組、山田君！　小学校のころから\nずっと大好きでした！　付き合ってくださ～～～い！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5f94297bb004de7a9261b00f721eba5771b41f279e5325f6d39cbf43f87c7366","ja":"山田君！？　どこどこ！？\nどこにいるの！？　あっ、いたーっ！","zh":"山田君！？在哪在哪！？\n你在哪里呀！？啊，找到了——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"31c22e70754c79b7d7274c1f250f056040b5a74edc482978a53bfc5ab704353b","ja":"「……ごめんなさい！　好きな人がいます！」","zh":"“……对不起！我有喜欢的人了！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2ca0b83f9c8fd31543e469d47a871372f770d1e14d2542ebeeec94e95ff033f1","ja":"「……！\nき、聞いてくれて……ありがとう……ございました！」","zh":"「……！\n谢、谢谢你们……倾听这首歌……！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"683cfbc1600790c916e0168bd54ccfe3134699ff8df1602d2455044e6c3fc411","ja":"ダメだったか……。\n残念だったね……って、えっ！？　恵美ちゃん！？","zh":"不行吗……。\n真遗憾啊……等等，诶！？　恵美！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ec164b0b3a087bb52174ee3bb1f29c4611729fd568ce447c51d4b5b26855d0e2","ja":"うっ……すごいね、勇気出して告白して！\nほ、ほんと……尊敬する！　でも……つらいよね……！","zh":"呜……真了不起，鼓起勇气去告白了！\n真、真的……好佩服你！但是……很难过吧……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ad01c2b23dca8639ece034a966d62938b800efe5ad86796d4c9755f7d0be163b","ja":"そうだね……。でも最後までしっかり話してて\n……すっごくかっこよかったよ！　素敵だった！","zh":"是啊……不过你一直好好说到最后了\n……真的超级帅气哦！太棒了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fad5c9b4b3cde8dd4c2150309f2bc1a64fc8f9ee8901291593b82382cfa09dc9","ja":"茜ちゃんも、感動しちゃったよ！","zh":"小茜也很感动哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ac6adcc413ce71d1ef84822479dd69d866677639c9c43b8843f9c4cdadcecebc","ja":"「あ、ありがとう、ございます……。\n…………ぐすっ……」","zh":"「谢、谢谢、您……。\n…………呜呜……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c512b59215e4f7f0ae765283fc11051f510ee3367df7e1dcd1c1a0d68da4448a","ja":"よーしっ、それじゃあ最後は……\n茜ちゃんたちの出番だよーっ！","zh":"好——嘞，那么最后是……\n该小茜她们出场啦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"05b3221e9cf347bace2658dfc0536ef98402162fb694c1cc374c5583903fe3d5","ja":"……えっ？　どうゆうこと？","zh":"……诶？什么意思？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c3a2b14be44cdb5ce8a64f6e70f4a77c4441b4a55d0f4fe7100d072559ad9e7f","ja":"せっかく盛り上がってるんだもん、\nここはもう、茜ちゃんたちもやるっきゃないでしょ！","zh":"难得气氛这么热烈，\n这种时候，小茜她们也只能全力以赴了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cce1a01e6667cc4ff6762550a873e92dee6a3f2fbfbd3010f1b39f12c79151c5","ja":"わ、私達もやるの！？　でも、ええと……\nスタッフさんたちに確認してみないと……。","zh":"我、我们也要做吗！？可是，那个……\n得先跟工作人员确认一下才行……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b887c9a1f4bdb03cbdde1890539acbc643360419ffd9d99a897107da64383570","ja":"「いきなりですね。\nそれは……もちろんオッケーで～～す！」","zh":"「太突然了吧。\n那当然……没问题啦～～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1676.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"08390f427071939e2c196b5ced2fd813fc5cc1ea0fe21159397e090eeacd7fd4","ja":"にゃははっ、ノリノリだね～！　そんじゃ、\n叫ばせてもらおっか！　アタシたちの気持ちも！","zh":"喵哈哈，情绪很高涨嘛～！那么，\n就让我们喊出来吧！我们的心意也是！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
